Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aegis <ops@aegis.local>
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Depends: ca-certificates
Description: Aegis unified endpoint and sensor agent
 One binary with explicit full, sensor and endpoint modes. The package installs
 the systemd unit and leaves enrollment token provisioning to the operator or
 MDM. It does not start the service automatically.
